<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Orbotech upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Orbotech upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said analyst Victor Halpert upgraded to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- cited better-than-expected second quarter earnings.</p>
<p>-- raised 1997 earnings per share estimate to $2.44 from $1.96, and 1998 view to $2.86 from $2.28.</p>
<p>-- has 12-month price target of $50-$53.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 1-7/8 to 44.</p>
